# Asset Store texture packs. Only the three materials the study scenes actually
# reference are kept, together with their five textures. The remaining ~280 MB of
# both packs stays out. Anything newly added to these folders is ignored by default,
# so re-importing a full pack locally cannot commit it by accident.
/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/**
/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/YughuesFreeFlooringMaterials/**
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/Materials/
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/Materials.meta
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/textures/
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/textures.meta
