!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/**/brick_04.*
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/TexturesPart01/**/brick_04_NRM.*
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/YughuesFreeFlooringMaterials/
!/[Aa]ssets/AvatarShaderExperimental/YughuesFreeFlooringMaterials/Materials/
